      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I predict that District 2 (The Hub) will become the primary hotspot for the initial outbreak. This is because the high density of low-income, immigrant residents will lead to closer living quarters, facilitating the rapid spread of the virus. The heavy reliance on public transit will also increase the likelihood of person-to-person transmission, as people from different backgrounds interact closely in crowded public spaces. Additionally, the multi-generational housing will allow the virus to spread quickly through families, further exacerbating the outbreak.",
